//
// A parse or resolution error prints the message and a three-line excerpt
// naming the file, the line, and the offending token.
//
// ⚠️ The excerpt is part of the observable surface, colour included: the
// harness transliterates the escapes rather than stripping them, so a change
// of colour is a change of expected output.

